{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/1_opt.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. Combine the effects of more than <strong>100 different</strong> dice and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and fearsome bosses that will require a perfect symbiosis in your deck in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/boss_alla.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated runs, roguelike style!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than <strong>100 dice</strong> with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than <strong>50 rings</strong> with passive effects to completement your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different enchantments that could drastically modify the behaviour of your dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different <strong>hands (classes)</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of unlocks</strong> and secret achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 one-time use cards</strong> to help you fight RNG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Millions of points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/opt_4.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And most importantly...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Break the game</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(It is one of those)</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430340?t=1740683448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740683448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/25358bf195f25c3afff370997f93dd41599115cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740683448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/25358bf195f25c3afff370997f93dd41599115cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740683448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3497720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You like big numbers? Sure, got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/1_opt.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dice A Million is a roguelike deckbuilder about rolling dice to try and get to a million points. Combine the effects of more than <strong>100 different</strong> dice and discover <strong>powerful synergies</strong>. Get through ever-increasing debts and fearsome bosses that will require a perfect symbiosis in your deck in order to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Will you be able to push luck to your side?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/boss_alla.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated runs, roguelike style!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than <strong>100 dice</strong> with unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than <strong>50 rings</strong> with passive effects to completement your build</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different enchantments that could drastically modify the behaviour of your dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different <strong>hands (classes)</strong> to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of unlocks</strong> and secret achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 one-time use cards</strong> to help you fight RNG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Millions of points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/extras/opt_4.gif?t=1740683448\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And most importantly...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Break the game</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(It is one of those)</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["countlessnights"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430340/header.jpg?t=1740683448","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101841,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101841/movie480.mp4?t=1740414631","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101841/movie_max.mp4?t=1740414631"},"name":"DEMO Trailer","thumbnail":"https://sh